# IFOS software catalog — Development
Visual Studio Code|Microsoft's editor, fully open-source build|code|repo
Neovim|Modern vim, with LSP support built in|neovim|repo
Base development tools|Compilers and build tooling (needed for AUR packages)|base-devel|repo
Git tooling|lazygit, git-delta and GitHub CLI|lazygit git-delta github-cli|repo
Docker|Containers, with docker compose|docker docker-compose|repo
Podman|Daemonless containers|podman podman-compose|repo
Python toolchain|pip, virtualenv and IPython|python-pip python-virtualenv ipython|repo
Node.js|JavaScript runtime with npm|nodejs npm|repo
Rust|rustup toolchain manager|rustup|repo
Go|Go compiler and tooling|go|repo
JetBrains Toolbox|Installer for IntelliJ, PyCharm, CLion and friends|jetbrains-toolbox|aur
Virtual machines|QEMU/KVM with the virt-manager GUI|qemu-desktop libvirt virt-manager dnsmasq edk2-ovmf|repo
